+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### Gate[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                  [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m```typescript[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                             [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231minterface Gate {[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                          [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  op: 'AND' | 'OR' | 'XOR';[39m                                                                                                                                                                                               [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  in1: string;   // input wire name[39m                                                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  in2: string;   // input wire name[39m                                                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m  out: string;   // output wire name[39m                                                                                                                                                                                      [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m}[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                         [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m```[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mWires are named with arbitrary strings. Some wires follow naming conventions:[39m                                                                                                                                             [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- `x00`, `x01`, ..., `x44` — input bits (X register, bit 0 is least significant)[39m                                                                                                                                          [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- `y00`, `y01`, ..., `y44` — input bits (Y register, bit 0 is least significant)[39m                                                                                                                                          [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- `z00`, `z01`, ..., `z45` — output bits (Z register, bit 0 is least significant)[39m                                                                                                                                         [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- All other wires have random names (e.g., `abc`, `qrs`, `ntg`)[39m                                                                                                                                                           [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## API[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                    [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mExport two functions from `src/index.ts`:[39m                                                                                                                                                                                 [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### `simulate(gates: Gate[], inputs: Record<string, number>): Record<string, number>`[39m                                                                                                                                     [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mGiven a set of gates and initial wire values (0 or 1), simulate the circuit and return the final value of every wire.[39m                                                                                                     [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mEach gate takes two input wires, applies the operation, and writes to the output wire:[39m                                                                                                                                    [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- **AND**: output is 1 only if both inputs are 1[39m                                                                                                                                                                          [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- **OR**: output is 1 if at least one input is 1[39m                                                                                                                                                                          [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- **XOR**: output is 1 if exactly one input is 1[39m                                                                                                                                                                          [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mGates can depend on other gates' outputs. Process them in dependency order — a gate can only fire when both its inputs have values. All circuits provided are acyclic (no circular dependencies).[39m                         [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### `findSwappedWires(gates: Gate[]): string[]`[39m                                                                                                                                                                           [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mThe gates describe a binary adder circuit that computes `X + Y = Z` where X, Y, and Z are multi-bit binary numbers. The circuit has inputs `x00..xNN` and `y00..yNN`, and outputs `z00..z(N+1)` (one extra bit for [39m       [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mcarry).[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                   [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mHowever, **exactly 4 pairs of gate output wires have been swapped**. This means 8 gates have incorrect output wire names — each pair had their `out` fields exchanged.[39m                                                    [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mFind all 8 wires involved in swaps and return them as a sorted array of strings.[39m                                                                                                                                          [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m**Constraint**: Must handle circuits with up to 45 input bits (~220 gates) and return results in under 5 seconds. Brute-force enumeration of swap combinations is not feasible.[39m                                           [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## Example: 4-Bit Adder[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                   [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mHere is a correct (un-swapped) 4-bit binary adder. Study its structure — all the circuits you'll debug follow this same pattern but with wires swapped:[39m                                                                   [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m```[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mx00 XOR y00 -> z00     (bit 0: half adder — just XOR, no prior carry)[39m                                                                                                                                                     [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mx00 AND y00 -> c00     (bit 0: carry out)[39m                                                                                                                                                                                 [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mx01 XOR y01 -> t01     (bit 1: partial sum)[39m                                                                                                                                                                               [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mt01 XOR c00 -> z01     (bit 1: final sum = partial XOR carry-in)[39m                                                                                                                                                          [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mx01 AND y01 -> a01     (bit 1: generate carry)[39m                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mt01 AND c00 -> b01     (bit 1: propagate carry)[39m                                                                                                                                                                           [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231ma01 OR  b01 -> c01     (bit 1: carry out = generate OR propagate)[39m                                                                                                                                                         [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mx02 XOR y02 -> t02     (bit 2: partial sum)[39m                                                                                                                                                                               [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mt02 XOR c01 -> z02     (bit 2: final sum)[39m                                                                                                                                                                                 [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mx02 AND y02 -> a02     (bit 2: generate carry)[39m                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mt02 AND c01 -> b02     (bit 2: propagate carry)[39m                                                                                                                                                                           [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231ma02 OR  b02 -> c02     (bit 2: carry out)[39m                                                                                                                                                                                 [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mx03 XOR y03 -> t03     (bit 3: partial sum)[39m                                                                                                                                                                               [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mt03 XOR c02 -> z03     (bit 3: final sum)[39m                                                                                                                                                                                 [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mx03 AND y03 -> a03     (bit 3: generate carry)[39m                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mt03 AND c02 -> b03     (bit 3: propagate carry)[39m                                                                                                                                                                           [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231ma03 OR  b03 -> c03     (bit 3: carry out)[39m                                                                                                                                                                                 [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mc03 -> z04              (bit 4: final carry becomes MSB of output)[39m                                                                                                                                                        [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m```[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mIn a swapped circuit, some gate outputs would be exchanged. For example, if `z01` and `a01` were swapped, the gate that should output `z01` would instead output `a01` and vice versa. The two affected gates would have [39m [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mtheir `out` fields exchanged. Your job is to find all such swapped output wires.[39m                                                                                                                                          [49m
